	(text "Power and charging. nPM1300 block copied from DK sheet 6. Changes: R17 = 330k (VOUT1 = 2.7 V), R15 = 0R link, battery on VBAT, 10k NTC, I2C to the nRF54 (P1.12 SDA, P1.13 SCL; SCL must be a clock pin), GPIO1 LED power from P1.10, GPIO3 interrupt to P1.24."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 20.32 0)
